<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barley major sales activity in the week ended Sept 12 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p>Mexico	   40,000		    Nil</p>
<p>Sales of 40,000 tonnes were four times higher than the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 32,900 tonnes were all to Mexico.</p>
